  "text": "Skip to content\nAbout\nInjectables\nOpen Injectables\nTreatments\nOpen Treatments\nWellness\nOpen Wellness\nSkincare\nGallery\nContact\nBook Now\nNo products in the cart.\n0\nCart\nTimeless Beauty, Crafted Care.\n\nEmbark on a transformative experience at Curated Medical, your ultimate destination medical spa in Scottsdale, AZ. Our medspa is dedicated to embracing luxury aesthetics and promoting beautiful, healthy aging.\u00a0\n\nView More\nTransformative Results\nLuxury Experience\nCustomized Plans\nExpert Care\nMore Than Just a Medical Spa.\nAbout Us\nGet to Know Our Team of Experts.\n\nAt our Scottsdale medical spa, we go beyond the typical standard experience of other med spas by offering personalized treatments that utilize the latest advancements in aesthetic technology.\n\nDr. Katie Mann, DNP, FNP-C\nFounder and Aesthetic Nurse Practitioner\nLuxury Meets Comfort.\n\nEnhance your natural beauty and embrace the transformative journey ahead at our Scottsdale Med Spa.\n\nNO.\n01\nThe Curated Medical Approach\n\nPersonalized and innovative plans to help you look and feel your best over time.\n\nNO.\n02\nTransformative Results\n\nAesthetic treatments catering to your needs to provide flawless and \u201cwow\u201d results!\n\nNO.\n03\nTrained Beauty Experts\n\nTrained in advanced injectables, laser treatments, skin rejuvenation, and more.\n\nNO.\n04\nFive-Star Experience\n\nIndulge in ultimate luxury and comfort at our beautiful state-of-the-art medical spa.\n\nEmpowering our clients to feel beautiful, inside and out.\n\nCustom treatments for your specific needs\nDiscover your bespoke journey\nView Our Med Spa Services.\nOur Services\nInjectables\nBotox, Dysport, Dermal Fillers, and more.\nTreatments\n\nLaser, Facials, Microneedling, and more.\n\nWellness\n\nDiscover vitality and embrace rejuvenation.\n\nShop Skincare\n\nElevate your beauty with skincare essentials.\n\nSee Why Our Clients Love Curated Medical\nTestimonials\nKatie and her team at Curated M