s for my skin needs.\nSonya H.\nBy sticking with Curated Medical, I know my skin is on the right track for aging the best it can!!!\nAmber B.\nI\u2019m approaching my 40th birthday this year and I feel so confident about that thanks to my visits with her - thanks Katie!\nSarah C.\nExplore the latest tips and trends\nFresh Beauty Perspectives.\nRecent Blog Posts\nVivace RF Microneedling in Scottsdale: The Treatment for Skin Laxity That Actually Works\n\nMost people don\u2019t notice skin laxity when it first starts. But they\n\nFacial Balancing Explained: Why Treating One Feature Alone Looks Unnatural\n\nTreating concerns in isolation is one of the most common reasons aesthetic\n\nMidface Support vs Cheek Filler: What\u2019s the Difference and Which One Do You Actually Need?\n\nWhen most people hear \u201ccheek filler,\u201d they picture dramatic cheekbones and sharply\n\nSchedule an Appointment\nwith one of our expert providers\nSchedule Appointment\n480.826.1139\nhello@curatedmed.com\nInstagram\n \nFacebook-f\nEnter your email below to sign up for our newsletter\nEmail\nSend\nAlternative:\n\n8300 Hayden Rd A117,\nScottsdale, AZ 85258\n\nCompany\nAbout\nFinancing\nMembership\nMedia\nGallery\nBlog\nServices\nInjectables\nTreatments\nWellness\nSkincare\nReviews\nSkincare\nShop All\nMy Account\nMy Orders\nShipping/Returns\n\u00a9 2026 Curated Medical. All Rights Reserved.\nPrivacy\nTerms & Conditions\n\nSite by AVINTIV",
